<navigation-bar title="设备配对码" back="{{true}}" color="#1b2033" background="#f5f6fa"></navigation-bar>
<view class="ff-page"><view class="ff-body"><view class="ff-card">
  <view class="ff-card__title">后台生成的设备配对码</view>
  <view class="ff-muted">配对码由后台生成并绑定客户。设备连接网络后，请在设备本地网页输入下方配对码；小程序不输入、不创建配对码。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{!pairingCodes.length}}" class="ff-muted">当前没有有效配对码，请联系后台管理员生成。</view>
  <view wx:for="{{pairingCodes}}" wx:key="code" class="ff-card" style="margin-top:16rpx;background:#f7f9fc">
    <view class="ff-muted">有效期至 {{item.expiresAt}}</view>
    <view style="font-size:52rpx;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:10rpx;text-align:center;color:#2864e8">{{item.code}}</view>
    <view class="ff-muted">设备本地网页输入此配对码后完成绑定</view>
  </view>
  <view class="ff-btn ff-btn--block" bindtap="onRefresh">{{loading ? '刷新中...' : '刷新配对码'}}</view>
</view></view></view>
